# Lurrus of the Dream-Den is a permission to cast a permanent spell with mana value 2 or less from the graveyard, so it lets a
# card with bestow be cast for its bestow cost, an alternative cost of its own (CR 601.3, 118.9, 702.103a): the bestowed
# Springheart Nantuko is an Aura enchantment spell of mana value 2 (CR 702.103b), which Lurrus allows. Faithless Looting puts
# the Nantuko in the graveyard on turn 3, and Bot1 casts it from there bestowed on Llanowar Elves for {1}{G} - Forest and Mox
# Emerald, nothing left over - so the Elves are 2/2 and the Nantuko is no creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Lurrus of the Dream-Den
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Faithless Looting
Springheart Nantuko
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

